.TOC
DATA MANAGEMENT COMMANDS:

LISTCAT    List catalog.
LISTDS     List dataset properties.
PRINTDS    Print contents of a dataset.

SYSTEM COMMANDS:

SHOWLOG    Print system log.

SESSION COMMANDS:

HELP       Invoke the help system.
LOGOFF     Log off current TSO session.
SYSTEM     Print system information.

For more information enter HELP COMMANDNAME or HELP HELP
.END

.CMD HELP
.FUNCTION
The help command.
.SYNTAX
HELP [COMMAND]
.END

.CMD SYSTEM
.FUNCTION
The system command prints the system software version and available
memory.
.SYNTAX
SYSTEM
.END
